# TemanKu sound effects (audio/sound_service.dart, audio/app_sound_service.dart)
#
# correct.mp3, try_again.mp3, session_complete.mp3 in this folder are
# PLACEHOLDER SILENT STUB FILES (0 bytes) — not synthesized audio, just empty
# files so the app compiles, bundles, and runs cleanly with sound wired up but
# nothing audible yet. AppSoundService.play* fails silently on them, same as
# it would on any missing/corrupt asset.
#
# TODO(IT-2): replace each with real audio before demo. Constraints (§ sound
# design, SimpleTEA's "encouraging not repressive" principle — see
# sound_service.dart's doc comment for the full rationale):
#   - correct.mp3 and try_again.mp3 must be TONALLY EQUIVALENT: same
#     instrument family, same warmth, similar (short) duration. Distinct
#     enough to be informative (different pitch/pattern), but neither may
#     sound like a punishment or an alarm — think "two friendly chimes," not
#     "success fanfare vs. error buzzer".
#   - session_complete.mp3: calm, no fanfare, no "you win" register — same
#     no-celebration tone as widgets/mastery_closure_prompt.dart's copy.
#   - Every file under ~1 second, soft attack/decay — no sudden loud onset.
#   - No looping — these are one-shot chimes, never background music.
#
# No code change needed once real files land here; the loader just plays
# whatever's actually in this folder.
